      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "BULL MARKET (8) goes very well this trip starting 11 times for four wins and four minors. In the money last time at this track (29.54) in a Grade 5, finishing a 0.8 lengths second. Looks suited and should go close. ZIPPING MILANO (3) is in hot form winning his last two on end, the latest jumping from this same box to score in a Grade 5 at Richmond (29.70). With a good start should be able to take advantage of the low draw. Harder here but expected to measure up. TAW MYSTIQUE (2) stalked the lead from the inside draw before finishing second last start (24.95) at Goulburn in Grade 5 over 440m. Racing well and deserves a win. LADY LLORONA (1) is right in the mix.",
